    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      233.65,
      146.3,
      246.93
    ],
    "text": "1002.0 grams.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      264.4,
      526.44,
      277.68
    ],
    "text": "The petitioner has made this application before us under section 83 of the Poisons, Opium",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      285.04,
      526.08,
      298.32
    ],
    "text": "and Dangerous Drugs (Amendment) Act, No.41 of 2022. As for the provisions of section",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      305.8,
      104.06,
      319.08
    ],
    "text": "83(2),",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      336.4,
      526.1,
      349.68
    ],
    "text": "\u201c83(2) notwithstanding the provisions of sections 84 and 85, a person suspected or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
