  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      350.68,
      526.03,
      363.96
    ],
    "text": "circumstances, it is apparent that he has been produced before medical officers time to time",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      371.32,
      526.43,
      384.6
    ],
    "text": "for ill health and according to the page number \u201834\u2019 of the High Court case record annexed",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      392.08,
      526.25,
      405.36
    ],
    "text": "and submitted as \u2018X\u2019, it is confirmed that the suspect has undergone a surgery for a kidney",
